'''''XTB KSW 123: Mircea vs. Held''''' was a [[mixed martial arts]] event that was held by [[Konfrontacja Sztuk Walki]] on November 21, 2026, at [[Enea Arena]] in [[Szczecin]], Poland.

===Background===
The event marked the promotion's fifth visit to Szczecin and first since [[2025 in Konfrontacja Sztuk Walki#XTB KSW 112: Kaczmarczyk vs. Soldaev|KSW 112]] in November 2025.<ref>{{Cite web |date=2026-09-03 |title=Adrian Bartosiński vs Tymoteusz Łopaczyk o pas na KSW 123 w Szczecinie! |url=https://fightsport.pl/newsy/adrian-bartosinski-vs-tymoteusz-lopaczyk-o-pas-na-ksw-123-w-szczecinie |access-date=2026-09-04 |website=FightSport.PL |language=pl-PL}}</ref>

A [[KSW Welterweight Championship]] bout between the reigning champion [[Adrian Bartosiński]] and [[Tymoteusz Łopaczyk]] was scheduled to headline the event.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Nielubiak |first=Gregorz |date=2026-09-03 |title=Masaev znowu kontuzjowany. Bartosiński podejmie Łopaczyka na gali XTB KSW 123 |url=https://inthecage.pl/masaev-znowu-kontuzjowany-bartosinski-podejmie-lopaczyka-na-gali-xtb-ksw-123/ |access-date=2026-09-04 |website=InTheCage.pl |language=pl-PL}}</ref> However, Bartosiński withdrew from the event due to an injury, so the bout was removed from the event.<ref name="KSW123">{{Cite web |last=Stachura |first=Bartłomiej |date=2026-11-13 |title=Trzęsienie ziemi w rozpisce KSW 123 – Adrian Bartosiński i inni wypadają, nowe walki ogłoszone, w tym starcie Mariana Ziółkowskiego |url=https://www.lowking.pl/trzesienie-ziemi-w-rozpisce-ksw-123-adrian-bartosinski-i-inni-wypadaja-nowe-walki-ogloszone-w-tym-starcie-mariana-ziolkowskiego/ |access-date=2026-11-13 |website=Lowking.pl |language=pl-PL}}</ref>

A [[KSW Lightweight Championship]] bout for the vacant title between former interim champion [[Valeriu Mircea]] and [[Marcin Held]] was scheduled to serve as the co-main event.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Nielubiak |first=Gregorz |date=2026-09-05 |title=Mircea vs Held! Starcie o pas wagi lekkiej na XTB KSW 123 w Szczecinie |url=https://inthecage.pl/mircea-vs-held-starcie-o-pas-wagi-lekkiej-na-xtb-ksw-123-w-szczecinie/ |access-date=2026-09-15 |website=InTheCage.pl |language=pl-PL}}</ref> After the original headliner was cancelled, the bout served as the event's official headliner.<ref name="KSW123"/>

A welterweight bout between Oskar Szczepaniak and Steven Krt was scheduled at the event, but Krt pulled out due to an injury and was replaced by Michał Hir in a 174 pounds catchweight bout.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Hryniewicz |first=Jakub |date=2026-10-29 |title=Oskar Szczepaniak z nowym rywalem na XTB KSW 123. Hir zastąpił Krt |url=https://mymma.pl/oskar-szczepaniak-z-nowym-rywalem-na-xtb-ksw-123-hir-zastapil-krt/ |access-date=2026-10-31 |website=myMMA.pl |language=pl-PL}}</ref> In turn, Hir pulled out for unknown reasons and was replaced by Arbi Dzhambulatov.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Chmura |first=Tomasz |date=2026-11-13 |title=Fala kontuzji! Bartosiński vs Łopaczyk i inne walki odwołane! Ogromne zmiany przed XTB KSW 123 {{!}} MMAROCKS |url=https://www.mmarocks.pl/ksw/fala-kontuzji-bartosinski-vs-lopaczyk-i-inne-walki-odwolane-ogromne-zmiany-przed-ksw-123 |access-date=2026-11-13 |website=MMA Rocks! |language=pl-PL}}</ref>

In addition, a middleweight bout between Tomasz Romanowski and [[Igor Michaliszyn]] was removed from the event for unknown reasons.<ref>{{Cite web |last=Nielubiak |first=Gregorz |date=2026-11-13 |title=Nowe starcie wieczoru i inne zmiany w karcie walk gali XTB KSW 123 |url=https://inthecage.pl/nowe-starcie-wieczoru-i-inne-zmiany-w-karcie-walk-gali-xtb-ksw-123/ |access-date=2026-11-13 |website=InTheCage.pl |language=pl-PL}}</ref>

At the weigh-ins, [[Kamil Szkaradek]] weighed in at 138 pounds, two pounds over the bantamweight limit. The bout proceeded at catchweight. Szkaradek was deducted one-point at the start of the fight and was fined 30 percent of his purse, which went to [[Rogério Bontorin]].<ref>{{Cite web |last=Stachura |first=Bartłomiej |date=2026-11-20 |title=Kamil Szkaradek przekroczył wagę – ukarany przed starciem z Rogerio Bontorinem na KSW 123 |url=https://www.lowking.pl/kamil-szkaradek-przekroczyl-wage-ukarany-przed-starciem-z-rogerio-bontorinem-na-ksw-123/ |access-date=2026-11-20 |website=Lowking.pl |language=pl-PL}}</ref>

